      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be incredibly beneficial for local streaming of club video content for production (e.g producing sets for a club like Furality Club F.Y.N.N). \n\nOur tools (Resolume, OBS, etc) already emit Spout shared textures. With native Spout reading in VRChat, we'd skip encoding/streaming middlemen like MediaMTX which have been a source of pain, inconsistencies, latency. Spout input support would thus greatly improve speed of iteration and quality of productions.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
